# Core Principles

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) at session start. Follow [CONSTITUTION.md](../../CONSTITUTION.md).

## Non-negotiables

1. **Spec-first**: No implementation without clear acceptance criteria
2. **Run sensors before done**: `cargo fmt --check && cargo clippy && cargo test && node scripts/harness-validate.mjs`
3. **Minimal scope**: Only change files required by the task
4. **Hashimoto principle**: Repeated failures → update HARNESS_CHANGELOG.md and fix harness

## Session protocol

- Start: read HANDOFF.md
- End: update HANDOFF.md, run sensors

## Trust

See [docs/en/agent-governance/trust.md](../../docs/en/agent-governance/trust.md). Default autonomy: L1.
